      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing some concerning physical symptoms when near electrical infrastructure. While some theories exist about the effects of electromagnetic fields, there is no credible scientific evidence to support the idea that the government intentionally uses grid frequencies to control people's mental states. Headaches and fog near electrical sources can sometimes be related to environmental factors or personal sensitivity, so consulting a healthcare professional to discuss your symptoms is highly recommended.",
